{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/Img2EN.png?t=1747656550\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore the roofs of panel houses, jump on garages, unscrew light bulbs in a shabby entrance. Or just wander aimlessly around a small courtyard, past old panel five-story buildings. There are no goals in this game other than those you set for yourself. In terms of gameplay, this is a classic walking simulator in recognizable scenery for people from the CIS. Just relax and spend time wandering around this place filled with post-Soviet atmosphere.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/Img3EN.png?t=1747656550\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Beat nettles with a stick</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/krapiva.png?t=1747656550\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Unscrew light bulbs in the entrance</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/lamps.png?t=1747656550\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Jump on roofs and garages</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/gameplay.png?t=1747656550\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Find and collect memes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/memes.png?t=1747656550\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/Img1EN.png?t=1747656550\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thanks to the advanced graphics of the 2005 Unity engine, you can fully enjoy the atmosphere of a quiet residential area.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/devgif.png?t=1747656550\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3747060?t=1747656550","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/aba8fbdd65a4e8e72eb90a8db8a3630455829254/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747656550","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/e61dc19083dce670b1937457bdee5a56201a9afd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747656550","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/e61dc19083dce670b1937457bdee5a56201a9afd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747656550","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/Img2EN.png?t=1747656550\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore the roofs of panel houses, jump on garages, unscrew light bulbs in a shabby entrance. Or just wander aimlessly around a small courtyard, past old panel five-story buildings. There are no goals in this game other than those you set for yourself. In terms of gameplay, this is a classic walking simulator in recognizable scenery for people from the CIS. Just relax and spend time wandering around this place filled with post-Soviet atmosphere.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/Img3EN.png